        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9007, Sleek Contemporary Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMinimalistic in design, the 9007 Cabinet Pull exemplifies the modern design aesthetic; but while the overall design might lack frills, it does not mean that it is boring. The sleekness of this Omnia made cabinet pull paired with a unique shape ensures that it will be an eye-catcher. It is available in polished chrome, oil-rubbed bronze, and satin nickel finishes in any of 6 different lengths ranging from 4 inches to 18 inches.\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/ultra-sleek-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9007p-400\"><b>Matching Curved Sub Zero Refrigerator Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Sleek Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9007/86:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 3-3/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9007/130:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 5-1/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9007/175:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 6-7/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9007/220:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 8-5/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9007/260:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 10-1/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9007/377:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 14-7/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
